# ===== Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest (21 steps) =========================================================
info title=The Arena
info author=Custom Islands
info description=An island built for a contest that still runs on its own: a great canopy of supplies in a meadow, cameras on poles, three rounds of beasts released by wardens who left long ago - and a door in the peak that opens only when the champion falls.
island on.arrive=message||A green plain under two peaks, a lake, and in a meadow a great canopy on poles with crates under it. On a pole by the beach, a camera turns to follow you.

story wardenpass|Gamewarden's pass|quest:Tangaroa_KeyCard|A gamewarden's pass on a lanyard, from the last gift of the games.
story prizekey|Prize vault key|quest:Caravan_KeyMayor|The prize vault's key, from the master console.

note rules Rules of the Arena | THE ARENA - RULES\n\n1. The games begin when a contestant steps onto a starting plate.\n2. There are three rounds. Survive each.\n3. The canopy holds supplies for those quick enough.\n4. A gift may fall from the sky for the worthy.\n5. The champion of the final round must fall.\n6. There is no rule six.\n\n- The Gamewardens (who are always watching)
note diary A contestant's diary | Day 2. The canopy, the boars, the run. Got a knife from the crates.\nDay 3. The hounds came at dusk.\nDay 4. I saw a warden - a man with a pass on a lanyard - walking out of the peak above the lake. There is a DOOR in the rock up there. It only opens when the games end.\nDay 5. The champion is a bear. A BEAR.\nDay 6. If you're reading this, I never got the pass. They drop it in the last gift before the final round - on the islet in the lake.\n- Pia
note wardenlog Gamewarden's log | ARENA CONTROL - SEASON 19\n\nStatus: running on automatic.\nThe wardens have left. The games run on their own until somebody shuts them down at the master console with a warden's pass.\nThe prize vault opens to the console's key.\n\nWhoever reads this has won. There is nobody left to congratulate you.
note horncrate Canopy supply crate | The canopy's crate: whatever a contestant can grab in ten seconds - a spear, bandages, food.
loot horncrate Spear_Scrap*1;HealingSalve*2;Cooked_GenericMeat*2;Rope*2
prop horncrate loot.refill=0
prop horncrate if.open=signal|round1
prop horncrate else.open=message||The crate is chained. Rule three: supplies for those quick enough - after round one.
prop horncrate on.open=message||Supplies! And somewhere a horn: twenty seconds to round two.\nwait|20\nshow|round2\nsound||event:/crafting/horns/air\nmessage||ROUND TWO - the hounds!
note supplydrop Supply drop | A crate on the islet under a sky-blue chute: a gamewarden's pass on a lanyard, a water flask, a note: "For the worthy." As you lift the pass, the horn sounds once, long.
loot supplydrop story:wardenpass*1;PlasticBottle_Water*2
prop supplydrop loot.refill=0
prop supplydrop on.open=wait|8\nshow|champion\nshow|finalmusic\nsound||event:/crafting/horns/air\nmessage||THE FINAL ROUND - the champion is in the meadow!
note prizevault Prize vault | The prize vault: a champion's sword, leather armour, the wardens' plans for their camera lines - and a heap of coins for a crowd that never came.
loot prizevault Sword_Titanium*1;Equipment_LeatherChest*1;Equipment_LeatherLegs*1;Blueprint_ZiplineTool*1;Blueprint_ZiplineBase*1;TradeToken*20
prop prizevault loot.refill=0
prop prizevault if.open=has|story:prizekey|1
prop prizevault else.open=message||The prize vault answers to the master console's key.
note leantobox Lean-to box | Pia's box under the tarp: a bow she made herself, arrows, string.
loot leantobox Bow*1;Arrow_Stone*12;Rope*2
prop leantobox loot.refill=0
prop seachest obj.name=seachest
note seachest Pia's sea chest | A crew chest of the shipping line, stencilled P. ANDERSSON - STEWARDESS. Before the games, Pia served on the liner. Inside: her uniform, her savings and the line's emergency kit.
loot seachest HealingSalve_Good*1;PlasticBottle_Water*2;TradeToken*3;Rope*2
prop seachest loot.refill=0
prop seachest if.open=has|story:stewardkey|1
prop seachest else.open=message||A crew chest of the shipping line, locked with the crew's lock. The chief steward's key ring opened every one of them - on the liner, before she sank.
note cache1 Sponsor's gift on the upland | A sponsor's gift among the rocks: bandages and good food.
loot cache1 HealingSalve_Good*1;Cooked_Salmon*2;Berries_Red*3
prop cache1 loot.refill=0
note cache2 Sponsor's gift by the trail | A sponsor's gift in a hollow: rope and planks for a shelter.
loot cache2 Plank*6;Rope*3;Nail*8
prop cache2 loot.refill=0
note lakecache Sunk gift | A gift that missed the islet and sank: metal for a better spear.
loot lakecache MetalIngot*2;Scrap*3;Bolt*2
prop lakecache loot.refill=0

prop horn tint.color=#d4a017
prop horn tint.amount=0.85
prop dropchute obj.name=supplydrop
prop dropchute beh.hidden=1
prop dropchute tint.color=#5aa0d8
prop dropchute tint.amount=0.6
prop ringzone zone.id=ring
prop ringzone zone.radius=13
prop ringzone zone.repeat=never
prop ringzone zone.message=You step onto a plate. Somewhere a camera clicks.
prop ringzone on.enter=sound||event:/crafting/horns/air\nshow|round1\nmessage||A horn blares across the plain - ROUND ONE!
prop round1 obj.name=round1
prop round1 beh.hidden=1
prop round1 creature.count=4
prop round1 creature.respawn=0
prop round1 on.defeat=signal||round1\nsound||event:/crafting/horns/air\nmessage||The horn: round one is over. The chain on the canopy's crate falls away.
prop round2 obj.name=round2
prop round2 beh.hidden=1
prop round2 creature.count=4
prop round2 creature.respawn=0
prop round2 on.defeat=show|supplydrop\nsound||event:/crafting/horns/air\nmessage||The horn: round two is over. Something drops out of the sky onto the lake's islet - a gift for the worthy.
prop supplydrop obj.name=supplydrop
prop supplydrop beh.hidden=1
prop champion obj.name=champion
prop champion beh.hidden=1
prop champion creature.count=1
prop champion creature.size=1.8
prop champion creature.health=4
prop champion creature.damage=2
prop champion creature.respawn=0
prop champion tint.color=#6a4a2a
prop champion tint.amount=0.4
prop champion on.defeat=open|hiddendoor\nhide|finalmusic\nsound||event:/exploring/temperence/selene/gate_open\nmessage||The champion falls. Up in the peak over the lake, a door you never saw slides open.
prop finalmusic obj.name=finalmusic
prop finalmusic beh.hidden=1
prop finalmusic sound.event=event:/music/music_boss
prop finalmusic sound.volume=0.6
prop finalmusic zone.radius=40
prop hiddendoorL obj.name=hiddendoor
prop hiddendoorL beh.move=0,0,1.3
prop hiddendoorL beh.moveTime=2
prop hiddendoorL beh.moveMode=switch
prop hiddendoorR obj.name=hiddendoor
prop hiddendoorR beh.move=0,0,-1.3
prop hiddendoorR beh.moveTime=2
prop hiddendoorR beh.moveMode=switch
prop console obj.name=console
prop console beh.use=Shut the games down with the warden's pass
prop console if.use=has|story:wardenpass|1
prop console on.use=message||You swipe the pass. GAMES ENDED, say the screens one after another - and outside, every camera on every pole stops turning. A drawer slides out of the console with a key in it.\ngive||story:prizekey*1\nsignal||gamesoff\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_selene_correct
prop console else.use=message||MASTER CONSOLE - WARDEN'S PASS REQUIRED.

prop shore zone.id=shore
prop shore zone.radius=8
prop shore zone.message=The arena's shore. A trail leads up onto the plain - past a camera on a pole, watching.
prop islet zone.id=islet
prop islet zone.radius=5
prop islet zone.message=The islet in the lake.
prop controlroom zone.id=controlroom
prop controlroom zone.radius=4
prop controlroom zone.message=The wardens' control room: a wall of screens showing the arena from every pole - and you, from behind.
prop forest sound.event=event:/amb/pineforest
prop forest sound.volume=0.5
prop forest zone.radius=80

story ta_top|Camera relay|Bolt|The relay box off the wardens' camera mast that watched the whole arena.
story ta_cave|Gate key|Bolt|The key to the sponsors' gate, hidden in a cave by a contestant who meant to come back.
story ta_fixed|Sponsors' gate working|Bolt|The sponsors' gate, working again.
note ta_hint Sponsor's notice | SPONSORS ONLY. Gate opens with the camera relay (mast on top of Victor's Rock) and the gate key (lost - try Hideout Cave). Ask Cassia at the lodge.
note ta_topchest Wardens' camera mast box | A box lashed to the top of the wardens' camera mast.
loot ta_topchest story:ta_top*1;Rope*2;Scrap*2
note ta_cavechest Hideout Cave chest | A chest at the back of Hideout Cave, dry under the rock.
loot ta_cavechest story:ta_cave*1;Nail*6;Plank*3
note ta_rewnote Sponsors' ledger | The gate swings open on the sponsors' box. On the desk, their ledger: bets on every contestant, year after year. Under the last name someone has written 'still alive'.
note ta_rewchest Sponsors' gate reward | What the sponsors' gate kept.
loot ta_rewchest CopperIngot*2;Bolt*3;Rope*2
note ta_lampchest Cassia's go-bag | Cassia's bag behind the lodge: a knife, line, and the token from her win.
loot ta_lampchest Rope*3;Leather*2;TradeToken*2
note ta_setchest Tribute chest | The wardens' tribute chest: all five tokens back, and the prizes nobody collected.
loot ta_setchest MetalIngot*2;Rope*4;TradeToken*2
note ta_planecrate Supply drop crate | A sponsors' supply crate still strapped in: bandages, water, a rope.
loot ta_planecrate Rope*3;Scrap*3;Plastic*2
prop ta_planecrate loot.refill=0
note ta_pilot Drop pilot's card | GIFT RUN 41. Two parachutes to drop. Wind took the plane, not the parachutes. Down on the shore.
note jcta Arena stacks | Training stacks from the old practice rounds. A tribute's stash half way.
loot jcta Rope*3;Plank*4;Wool*2
note jbta Top stack | A box at the very top.
loot jbta CopperIngot*1;Bolt*2;TradeToken*1
note ta_mazechest Round zero prize | The prize at the heart of round zero's maze: a contestant's pass and coins.
loot ta_mazechest TradeToken*3;CopperIngot*2;MetalIngot*1

quest title=The Games Run On
quest intro=An island built for a contest, still running on its own. The rules are posted at the meadow's edge. Start at the shore.
step reach|shore|1|Land on the shore below the great canopy
step read|Rules of the Arena|1|Read the rules posted at the meadow's edge
step reach|ring|1|Step onto a starting plate round the great canopy
step kill|Warthog|4|Round one: survive the boars
step open|Canopy supply crate|1|Open the supply crate under the great canopy
step read|A contestant's diary|1|Find last year's contestant's diary in the woods by the lake
step kill|Hyena|4|Round two: the hounds
step collect|story:wardenpass|1|Swim to the gift crate on the lake's islet for the warden's pass
step kill|Bear|1|The final round: the champion
step reach|controlroom|1|Find the door that opened in the peak
step read|Gamewarden's log|1|Read the gamewarden's log in the control room
step collect|story:prizekey|1|Shut the games down at the master console
step read|Sponsor's notice|1|Read the sponsor's notice by the sponsors' gate at the ruined house
step talk|Cassia Venn|1|Talk to Cassia Venn at the ruined house
step reach|ta_trail|1|Find the foot of the trail up Victor's Rock, the big rock hill
step reach|ta_summit|1|Climb the trail to the top of Victor's Rock
step collect|story:ta_top|1|Climb the wardens' camera mast and take the camera relay from its box
step reach|ta_cave|1|Find Hideout Cave, the cave in the rock
step collect|story:ta_cave|1|Take the gate key from the chest at the back of the cave
step read|Sponsors' ledger|1|Bring both to the sponsors' gate and read what it shows
step open|Prize vault|1|Open the prize vault
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineTool|1|Take the zipline tool plans from the prize vault
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineBase|1|Take the zipline base plans from the prize vault
quest done=The screens say GAMES ENDED and every camera on the island stops turning. You won - the only contestant in nineteen seasons to walk out through the wardens' door.
quest reward=MetalIngot*6;HealingSalve_Good*3;Cooked_GenericMeat*4

# --- Raft's vending machine at the arena's gate, from Tangaroa's arcade: Tangaroa's plants for its tokens; three tokens lie about --
vending gatevend at 4 -34 ground
place QuestItemPickup_Tangaroa_Token - at 0 -36 ground
place QuestItemPickup_Tangaroa_Token - at 12 -24 ground
place QuestItemPickup_Tangaroa_Token - at 28 -28 ground

